{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1415093-help-with-the-mobility-penalty-penalty-blues-for-armor","id":1415093,"title":"Help with the Mobility Penalty Penalty blues for armor","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-09-22T11:26:30-07:00","id":1415093,"title":"Help with the Mobility Penalty Penalty blues for armor","content":"I am looking for ways to offset a -2 mobility penalty for a nice set of heavy artifact armor my Abyssal character has, and I wanted to improve it in terms of mobility and possibly fatigue as well. One option is to figure out some sort of artifact armor upgrade, and another option is to attune to silversteel armor with those artifacts that let you do that. But I'd like something cleaner. A charm that lets me attune a bit more Essence to lower or remove the penalty? I have no idea if lowering mobility and fatigue is even possible, so I am just spitballing.<br /> <br /> What are my options for lowering the mobility and possibly fatigue penalties?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3814-g3taso","name":"g3taso","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3814_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"348"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-22T12:11:28-07:00","id":1415101,"title":"","content":"Solar resistance ignores armour penalties pretty early on, with no circumspection or complication.<br /> An Abyssal wouldn't be different in this regard.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""}